  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Enhancement of Transparency International Ukraine - 2027 - Institutional Enhancement of Transparency International Ukraine</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Institutionell f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttring av Transparency International Ukraina - 2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">De viktigaste m&#xe5;len f&#xf6;r insatserna &#xe4;r f&#xf6;ljande: Att bidra till att st&#xe4;rka en effektiv nationell politik mot korruption genom att utveckla och f&#xf6;respr&#xe5;ka normativa r&#xe4;ttsakter, samtidigt som offentlig &#xf6;vervakning och expertbed&#xf6;mning s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lls. fr&#xe4;mja ett &#xf6;ppet och ansvarstagande lokalt sj&#xe4;lvstyre, fr&#xe4;mja en &#xf6;kad grad av &#xf6;ppenhet i Ukrainas 100 st&#xf6;rsta st&#xe4;der samt f&#xf6;respr&#xe5;ka lag&#xe4;ndringar f&#xf6;r att &#xf6;ka insynen och ansvarsskyldigheten i lokala sj&#xe4;lvstyrande organ och bidra till en &#xf6;ppen och ansvarsfull &#xe5;terh&#xe4;mtning av Ukraina.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Key intervention&#x2019;s objectives are: to contribute to strengthening an Efficient national anti-corruption policy by development and advocacy of normative legal acts, while ensuring public monitoring and expert assessment; fostering transparent and accountable local self-government, nurturing an increase in the level of transparency in Ukraine&apos;s 100 largest cities, as well as advocating legislative changes to increase transparency and accountability of local self-government bodies and contributing to transparent and accountable recovery of Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Key interventions objectives are: 

- to contribute to strengthening an Efficient national anti-corruption policy by development and advocacy of normative legal acts, while ensuring public monitoring and expert assessment; fostering transparent and accountable local self-government;

- nurturing an increase in the level of transparency in Ukraine&apos;s 100 largest cities, as well as advocating legislative changes to increase transparency and accountability of local self-government bodies and contributing to transparent and accountable recovery of Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
